# bootstrap-ui plugin

- PHP 8.1+, CakePHP 5.3+, Bootstrap 5 HTML markup
- Small helper-only plugin: no controllers, routes, middleware, or assets unless explicitly requested
- Match existing patterns in `src/View/Helper/` (`StringTemplateTrait`, templates, `mergeAttributes`)
- Minimize scope; avoid drive-by refactors
- Never commit unless the user asks
- After edits: run `composer check` (or `composer test` for test-only changes)
- Static analysis: `composer analyse` (PHPStan level 8 on `src/`, Psalm)
